a coffee machine out before I forked

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.229
out that kind of money, and
so far it's been great.

00:00:12.239 --> 00:00:13.580
I mean, the machine's been wonderful.

00:00:13.719 --> 00:00:15.599
